# Trivy suppressions — each with a documented risk assessment.
# Reviewed as part of the SSDLC dependency-triage process (docs/security/ssdlc.md).

# react-router "RSC Mode CSRF" advisory. Keyway's web app is a static SPA
# (BrowserRouter + declarative routes, served as embedded static assets). It
# does NOT use React Router's RSC / server / data-action modes, which is the
# only configuration this advisory affects — so it is not exploitable here.
# Tracked for a future react-router bump via Dependabot.
